enges for machine learning. When these challenges are met, machine learning promises a future of rigorous, outcomes-based medicine with detection, diagnosis, and treatment strategies that are continuously adapted to individual and environmental differences.", "affiliation": "Department of Biomedical Engineering, Oregon Health & Science University, Portland, OR, USA. Electronic address: goecksj@ohsu.edu.", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't", "research-article", "Review", "Journal Article", "Research Support, N.I.H., Extramural"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "NCI NIH HHS", "acronym": "CA", "grantId": "U54 CA209988", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NCI NIH HHS", "acronym": "CA", "grantId": "U2C CA233280", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NCI NIH HHS", "acronym": "CA", "grantId": "U24 CA231877", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NHGRI NIH HHS", "acronym": "HG", "grantId": "U54 HG008100", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Cancer Institute", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Human Genome Research Institute", "orderIn": 0}]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Humans"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Machine Learning"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Precision Medicine"}]}, "subsetList": {"subset": [{"code": "IM", "name": "Index Medicus"}]}, "fullTextUrlList": {"fullTextUrl": [{"availability": "Subscription required", "availabilityCode": "S", "documentStyle": "doi", "site": "DOI", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2020.03.022"}, {"availability": "Free", "availabilityCode": "F", "documentStyle": "html", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC7141410"}, {"availability": "Free", "availabilityCode": "F", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC7141410?pdf=render"}, {"availability": "Free", "availabilityCode": "F", "documentStyle": "doi", "sit